WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.616
- We are back and so far this hour,

00:00:01.616 --> 00:00:04.170
we've unveiled never
before seen interviews

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.850
with couples and co-stars,

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.640
but some siblings are truly
perfect pairs as well,

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.830
especially Ron and Clint Howard.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.930
While they were here, Clint
shared a certain passion

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.360
that I'm totally into, as you'll see.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.690
So Clint, I heard you also
have an unusual hobby,

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:19.800
and I love this,

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.780
'cause I actually was
obsessed with snow globes

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.680
when I was a kid.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.850
I don't know why, and I still love them.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.590
I think they're magical and I
try to get my kids into them.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.210
But you love snow globes, you make them.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.043
- Yes, I do.

00:00:28.043 --> 00:00:29.880
I make one-offs from scratch.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:30.780
- That's amazing.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.460
So, I don't even know how you
would go about doing that,

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.120
I feel like you should come
back for a demo on that,

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.850
'cause I've never done that.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.950
But are you a fan of snow
globes, are you into them?

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:41.070
- I'm a particular fan of his snow globes

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:42.210
because they're so inventive.

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:44.430
They're a work of art really.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.080
They're eccentric, they're kooky.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.343
- [Kelly] Yeah, best kind.

00:00:47.343 --> 00:00:50.100
- Maybe he uses his Ice Cream Man voice

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.060
while he's making them.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:52.591
I don't know what trance he goes into.

00:00:52.591 --> 00:00:54.294
- [Kelly] Oh my God, I
just, I'll have nightmares.

00:00:54.294 --> 00:00:55.127
- But some of them are pretty weird,

00:00:55.127 --> 00:00:56.370
and some of them are very heartwarming,

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:58.140
but they're all totally originally

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.930
and honestly, they
really are works of art.

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:03.000
- Okay, well I think that
this picture that I found

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.410
goes actually, this is the best way

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:05.550
to sell your snow globes.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:08.160
I think this captures the
essence of snow globes.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.135
Right here.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:13.650
This is actually
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:15.660
I mean, this is, people

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:17.310
this is marketing at its finest.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.870
- Yeah, you're really helping
to sell our book here.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.052
- [Kelly] Yeah, yeah.

00:01:20.052 --> 00:01:21.277
Exactly, exactly.

00:01:21.277 --> 00:01:22.830
Your family-friendly book.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.270
- [Clint] Thank God for that Elvis.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.640
- It takes all kinds of
boys to make a family.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:27.473
See what I'm saying?

00:01:27.473 --> 00:01:30.090
But I love, is this, it reminded me.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:33.060
Is this of Burt Reynolds, back in the day

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.830
when he did that centerfold thing?

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:36.270
I actually saw that and I was like,

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:37.410
oh my God, it looks like
the Burt Reynolds thing

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:38.243
and they were like,

00:01:38.243 --> 00:01:39.270
I think he did a play off of that.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:40.380
Is that what it was?

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.420
- Well, Burt Reynolds
was friends with Dad.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:43.253
Burt Reynolds did an episode

00:01:43.253 --> 00:01:45.079
- Oh, your family as so
different from mine, okay.

00:01:45.079 --> 00:01:46.290
(audience laughing)

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.120
- Burt did an episode of "Gentle Ben"

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.132
so he's always been in my consciousness.

00:01:51.132 --> 00:01:54.450
Not the idea that I wanna
lay naked around snow globes,

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.640
but I was putting
together a Christmas card

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:57.630
and I felt like--

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.820
- Oh my god, it was a
Christmas card. (laughs)

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:02.850
(audience laughing)

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:03.683
- My brother.

00:02:03.683 --> 00:02:04.825
- I love it!

00:02:04.825 --> 00:02:07.030
You know what, we would
get along well, Clint.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:08.250
- Well, I was just trying

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.350
to take a photo of the snow globes.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:11.183
- Yeah.

00:02:11.183 --> 00:02:12.679
- And I thought it's missing something.

00:02:12.679 --> 00:02:14.520
- (laughs) My naked body.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:18.030
- So, dropped drawer
and jumped into the shot

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:19.860
and I got myself a winner to the point

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.410
where when I posted it on Facebook,

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:26.080
I was immediately put in
24-hour probationary jail

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.750
(Kelly laughing)
(audience clapping)

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.460
by Facebook.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.293
I swear.

00:02:32.072 --> 00:02:33.090
- [Kelly] It takes all kinds.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:35.840
- They were debating whether
it was pornography or not.

